Adreno740: a contiguous kernel buffer (allocate(contiguous=true)) the kernel cannot serve comes from one run of the board's pool (ruan).
ruan's kernel returns NULL for every physically contiguous IOBufferMemoryDescriptor (memory-outside adopts DRAM outside DarwinBoot's
window), so NativeAdrenoGpuContext::bringUp failed at step Allocate (e00002bd). The run is mapped write-combined in the kernel
(mapping_), its grant is released by release(). Applied by scripts/build-ruan-adreno.py; the core tree is not changed.

